        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, in the absence of patent protection, we may be vulnerable to competitors who attempt to imitate our products, manufacturing techniques, and processes and may be more limited in our ability to exclude competitors than would otherwise be the case.",
        "start_character": 35817,
        "end_character": 36071
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If our competitors make acquisitions or enter into strategic relationships with leading semiconductor manufacturers, or other entities, covering products similar to those we sell, our ability to sell our products to those customers could be adversely affected.",
        "start_character": 34038,
        "end_character": 34298
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect our competitors to continue to improve the design and performance of their current products and processes, to introduce new products and processes with enhanced price/performance characteristics, and to provide more comprehensive offerings of products.",
        "start_character": 33775,
        "end_character": 34037
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a broad range of services to deliver value throughout the lifecycle of our equipment, including customer service, spares, upgrades, and new and refurbished non-leading edge products in our deposition, etch, and clean markets.",
        "start_character": 5396,
        "end_character": 5630
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we may experience difficulty in selling to a given customer if that customer has qualified a competitor’s equipment.",
        "start_character": 32843,
        "end_character": 32972
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a public company with global operations, we are subject to a variety of governmental regulations across multiple jurisdictions, including those related to export controls, financial and other disclosures, corporate governance, anti-trust, intellectual property, privacy, anti-bribery, anti-corruption, anti-boycott, tax, tariffs, labor, health and safety, conflict minerals, human trafficking, the management of hazardous materials, and carbon emissions, among others.",
        "start_character": 26154,
        "end_character": 26625
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our goal is to apply our environmental health and safety (“EHS”) policies, programs, and response plans to anywhere we operate and to extend them to anyone who works on our sites with the intent to provide a safe environment during both routine and extraordinary circumstances.",
        "start_character": 39866,
        "end_character": 40143
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Through the spirit of continuous improvement, we accelerate skill building and development, create career opportunities, and expand professional networks for employees.",
        "start_character": 37537,
        "end_character": 37705
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe current challenges for customers at various points in the semiconductor manufacturing process present opportunities for us.",
        "start_character": 20444,
        "end_character": 20578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe we are in a strong position with our leadership and expertise in deposition, etch, and clean markets to facilitate some of the most significant innovations in semiconductor device manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 3480,
        "end_character": 3685
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have agreements with third parties to outsource certain aspects of our manufacturing, production warehousing, and logistics functions.",
        "start_character": 24661,
        "end_character": 24798
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000707549-25-000075",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000707549-25-000075-10fe15913ac43800",
        "accession_number": "0000707549-25-000075",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have built a strong global presence with core competencies in areas such as nanoscale manufacturing enablement, chemistry, plasma and fluidics, advanced systems engineering, and a broad range of operational disciplines.",
